{"id":"1cd156e08cdc8ce0","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-forcing-stationary-set-preserving-poset.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Stationary Set Preserving Poset","display":"df-zfc-forcing-stationary-set-preserving-poset — ZFC Forcing Stationary Set Preserving Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-stationary-set-preserving-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-stationary-set-preserving-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-stationary-set-preserving-poset — ZFC Forcing Stationary Set Preserving Poset","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-stationary-set-preserving-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-stationary-set-preserving-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-stationary-set-preserving-poset — ZFC Forcing Stationary Set Preserving Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\">\\((\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\)</span> (forcing poset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (regular uncountable cardinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{\\mathrm{Stat}}(v_0,v_1)\">\\(\\varphi_{\\mathrm{Stat}}(v_0,v_1)\\)</span> (a fixed object-language formula code saying that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span> is stationary in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1\">\\(v_1\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\Vdash_{V,(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})}\\varphi[\\vec\\tau]\">\\(p\\Vdash_{V,(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})}\\varphi[\\vec\\tau]\\)</span> (the ambient-universe forcing-relation class schema)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingStationarySetPreservingPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingStationarySetPreservingPoset}_S\\)</span> (metatheoretic predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}\\)</span> (predicates from the dependencies)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}set\\text{-}preserving\\text{-}poset}\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{ZfcForcingStationarySetPreservingPoset}_S\n(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall S\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\n\\to\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\np\\Vdash_{V,(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})}\n\\varphi_{\\mathrm{Stat}}[\\langle\\check S,\\check\\kappa\\rangle]\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}set\\text{-}preserving\\text{-}poset}\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\mathrm{ZfcForcingStationarySetPreservingPoset}_S\n(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall S\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\n\\to\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\np\\Vdash_{V,(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})}\n\\varphi_{\\mathrm{Stat}}[\\langle\\check S,\\check\\kappa\\rangle]\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The two-place stationarity formula and its two-name tuple are now separated from the external predicate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The forcing order is explicit. Ambient-universe forcing is a class schema and is therefore marked metatheoretic; no set-level six-place predicate is called with the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> as an argument.</li>\n<li>Every ground-model stationary subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> must remain stationary in the extension.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"46b2495f214783c3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_{\\mathrm{Stat}}(v_0,v_1)","display":false},{"tex":"v_0","display":false},{"tex":"v_1","display":false},{"tex":"p\\Vdash_{V,(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})}\\varphi[\\vec\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingStationarySetPreservingPoset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stationary}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}set\\text{-}preserving\\text{-}poset}\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\\\